  - sentence: The key... broke?
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 841a2d43033e7184f8f2499d39c312f4, type: 3}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
  - sentence: Or maybe...
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 841a2d43033e7184f8f2499d39c312f4, type: 3}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 1
  - sentence: I then checked each of the keys I was carrying.
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 1
  - sentence: Just as I thought, all of the colored tips turned out to be removable.
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 1
  - sentence: But why...?
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 1
  - sentence: '!!'
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: -5895795991965008814, guid: 251e04c764ee44b4fa4f073599c3f6c7, type: 3}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 1
  - sentence: So that means...
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
  - sentence: ...
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098f9939563dbb04c814c9c43fa318cf, type: 3}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1447365486}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: GameManager, Assembly-CSharp
